# GS26: from ml_aerie_lv15.sav (Lv 15): to the confrontation cell (21,14), B through the event, Saturos's battle by the scratch smartbot (SB_PLAN=3: turn 1 Isaac and Garet summon (Venus, Mercury), Garet unleashes Forge on turn 4, Mia plies below 85 %, Ivan Ray or Defend, Isaac Cure Well/Spire): Saturos falls after 13 turns (Isaac and Ivan down); 800 coins, a Psy Crystal; Alex appears, Saturos rises, the Mars Star question (B: No), they leave by the lift; Mia stays; B taps through; save at 20,12.
